{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1530403200, "end_date": 1531094399, "month_true_total": 52, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:51:11 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "43405420", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147568095", "personaname": "TheC", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thec/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 590, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 537, "last_played": 1664079527, "avatar": "33e9a7667a73b8a308f42617d52121a6e96985d2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "小玩了一下，感觉还阔以，不是那种会吸引你一直玩的游戏，但是因为非常轻松愉快不需要动脑子，隔一天闲了就想来一局。\n\n四个职业很有特色，如果有队友一起玩可以配合得非常出色。\n意外的是野队也很友好，基本上给个信号语音说一句需要搭个平台打个光拉个绳子挖个洞队友都会帮忙，挂掉疯狂按X队友也会大老远跑过来拉你，游戏体验可以说非常好了。\n\n升级感觉有点鸡肋？也可能是因为我玩的少，升了级在游戏里感觉没什么大区别。。。\n挖的矿不知道是全队共享还是只算自己的？每次都佛系挖矿懒得和队友抢，挖矿分都好低（\n\n缺点的话，还是游戏有点单调，三种模式其实都差不太多，没玩过4级难度，前3级都还算轻松。\n另外黑暗的环境其实很有搞头，音乐能哪怕做成minecraft在矿洞那种风格都能让气氛可怕十倍。现在是虽然洞很黑很深很大但是像在自己家一样完全不慌，感觉还是有点可惜的。\n\n总的来说，好评、推荐。", "timestamp_created": 1531070563, "timestamp_updated": 1531070563, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43376292", "author": {"steamid": "76561198260836774", "personaname": "old barry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198260836774/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 31486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1167, "last_played": 1724079270, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "你说得对，但多人游戏已终止", "timestamp_created": 1530969898, "timestamp_updated": 1719461731, "voted_up": tru